- `/Game/Study/CubeFluidNinjaLive/Art/Meshes/Tree/Textures/T_BlackAlder_TwoSided_Summer_Albedo`
- `/Game/Study/CubeFluidNinjaLive/Art/Meshes/Tree/Textures/T_BlackAlder_TwoSided_Summer_Mask`
